629
00:21:11,036 --> 00:21:12,171
Eric: THIS REALLY
IS HARD.

630
00:21:12,171 --> 00:21:13,672
Janice: IT'S REALLY HARD.

631
00:21:13,672 --> 00:21:16,041
MY HEAD.
UGH.

632
00:21:31,580 --> 00:21:34,049
