THE EXCLAMATION POINT ON,

649
00:22:33,349 --> 00:22:37,120
"I CAN BE EDGY,
AND I WILL BE EDGY."

650
00:22:37,120 --> 00:22:38,454
CONGRATULATIONS.

651
00:22:38,454 --> 00:22:40,056
YOU ARE ONE
OF THE FINALISTS.

652
00:22:40,056 --> 00:22:42,058
(laughing)

653
00:22:42,058 --> 00:22:43,593
