655
00:22:50,233 --> 00:22:52,602
THERE ARE TWO OF YOU
STANDING IN FRONT OF ME,

656
00:22:52,602 --> 00:22:56,039
BUT I ONLY HAVE ONE PHOTO
IN MY HANDS.

657
00:22:56,039 --> 00:22:59,242
BOTH OF YOU HAVE DONE SO WELL
THROUGHOUT THIS PROCESS.

658
00:22:59,242 --> 00:23:02,712
YOANNA, YOU STARTED OFF PRETTY
STRONG AND VERY KNOWLEDGEABLE.

659
00:23:02,712 --> 00:23:04,247
YOU WERE DOING
YOUR THING

660
00:23:04,247 --> 00:23:07,283
AND PROVING TO US WEEK TO WEEK
HOW GREAT YOU WALKED,

661
00:23:07,283 --> 00:23:08,451
HOW ORIGINAL
YOU WERE,

662
00:23:08,451 --> 00:23:10,553
