FOR SO LONG

914
00:31:51,607 --> 00:31:53,008
SINCE I WAS
A LITTLE GIRL,

915
00:31:53,008 --> 00:31:55,945
SO I'M GONNA BE
AMERICA'S NEXT TOP MODEL.

916
00:31:55,945 --> 00:31:56,645
Mercedes: DID YOU GET
EVERYTHING?

917
00:31:56,645 --> 00:31:58,314
Yoanna: YEAH.

918
00:31:58,314 --> 00:31:59,582
Mercedes: JUST LET ME KNOW
WHEN YOU'RE READY.

919
00:31:59,582 --> 00:32:01,717
YOANNA IS
A GREAT PERSON.

