IT WASN'T MEANT TO BE!"

924
00:32:10,559 --> 00:32:12,294
I'LL KILL HER.
(laughing)

925
00:32:12,294 --> 00:32:14,430
I'LL TAKE YOU
OUT OF THIS COMPETITION.

926
00:32:14,430 --> 00:32:15,698
Yoanna: (British accent)
I'M READY.

927
00:32:15,698 --> 00:32:16,465
Mercedes: (British accent)
ALL RIGHTY, THEN.

928
00:32:16,465 --> 00:32:17,600
Yoanna: MERCEDES...

929
00:32:17,600 --> 00:32:18,701
Mercedes: WE SHALL PART.

930
00:32:18,701 --> 00:32:21,637
♪♪♪

931
00:32:27,343 --> 00:32:29,078
Mercedes: ONWARD MARCH.

932
00:32:32,681 --> 00:32:35,551
♪♪♪

933
00:32:40,222 --> 00:32:42,391
Tyra: HI, LADIES.

934
00:32:42,391 --> 00:32:45,961
WE'VE WATCHED YOU TRANSFORM
FROM EVERYDAY LITTLE GIRLS

935
00:32:45,961 --> 00:32:50,032
TO REAL,
BONA FIDE MODELS.

936
00:32:50,032 --> 00:32:52,701
AND NOW IT'S TIME
FOR ONLY ONE OF YOU

937
00:32:52,701 --> 00:32:55,971
TO GRADUATE TO THE REAL WORLD
OF MODELING

938
00:32:55,971 --> 00:32:59,308
AS AMERICA'S
NEXT TOP MODEL.

939
00:32:59,308 --> 00:33:01,577
AMONG THE PRIZES
THAT THE WINNER WILL RECEIVE

940
00:33:01,577 --> 00:33:04,647
ARE A CONTRACT
WITH IMG MODELS,

941
00:33:04,647 --> 00:33:07,950
A FASHION SPREAD
IN "JANE" MAGAZINE

942
00:33:07,950 --> 00:33:11,353
AND A COSMETICS CAMPAIGN
WITH SEPHORA.

943
00:33:11,353 --> 00:33:14,590
AND FOR THE FINAL TIME
IN THIS COMPETITION,

944
00:33:14,590 --> 00:33:18,327
I'M GOING TO INTRODUCE
OUR PANEL OF JUDGES.

945
00:33:18,327 --> 00:33:20,729
FIRST IS ONE OF THE WORLD'S
FIRST SUPERMODELS,

946
00:33:20,729 --> 00:33:22,431
MISS JANICE DICKINSON.

947
00:33:22,431 --> 00:33:24,233
WE HAVE ALSO
ERIC NICHOLSON,

948
00:33:24,233 --> 00:33:26,535
WHO IS THE SENIOR FASHION EDITOR
OF "JANE" MAGAZINE.

949
00:33:26,535 --> 00:33:27,670
AND LAST
BUT NOT LEAST,

950
00:33:27,670 --> 00:33:29,505
WE HAVE
MR. NIGEL BARKER,

951
00:33:29,505 --> 00:33:31,307
A NOTED FASHION
PHOTOGRAPHER,

952
00:33:31,307 --> 00:33:35,411
AND HE ALSO PHOTOGRAPHED YOU ALL
IN YOUR VERY FIRST SHOOT.

953
00:33:35,411 --> 00:33:37,146
THERE IS NO GUEST JUDGE
TONIGHT

954
00:33:37,146 --> 00:33:40,216
BECAUSE WE HAVE SEEN YOU
FROM WEEK TO WEEK,

955
00:33:40,216 --> 00:33:42,685
WHEREAS A GUEST JUDGE
ONLY COMES IN FOR ONE WEEK.

956
00:33:42,685 --> 00:33:45,621
SO WE FEEL LIKE WE KNOW YOU
BETTER THAN ANYBODY

957
00:33:45,621 --> 00:33:48,224
IN THE WHOLE ENTIRE WORLD
RIGHT NOW

958
00:33:48,224 --> 00:33:50,693
WHEN IT COMES TO DECIDING
WHO HAS WHAT IT TAKES

959
00:33:50,693 --> 00:33:52,294
TO BE A STAR.

960
00:33:52,294 --> 00:33:54,563
NOW IT'S TIME FOR
YOUR INDIVIDUAL EVALUATIONS.

961
00:33:54,563 --> 00:33:56,932
AND THEN AFTER THAT,
THE JUDGES WILL DELIBERATE

962
00:33:56,932 --> 00:34:00,069
AND WILL DETERMINE WHICH ONE
OF YOU ALL WILL BECOME

963
00:34:00,069 --> 00:34:02,938
AMERICA'S NEXT
TOP MODEL.

964
00:34:02,938 --> 00:34:04,306
