YOANNA, THAT YOU DID,

990
00:34:54,290 --> 00:34:58,294
IS YOU WERE ON THE RIBBON,
BUT TOO MUCH.

991
00:34:58,294 --> 00:34:59,728
AND THEN, MERCEDES,
IN THE END, REMEMBER,

992
