1000
00:35:17,546 --> 00:35:19,715
YOU WERE BOTH EXTREMELY
PROFESSIONAL ON MY SETS.

1001
00:35:19,715 --> 00:35:21,617
Tyra: FOR YOUR VERY FIRST
PHOTO SHOOT,

1002
00:35:21,617 --> 00:35:23,719
