00:37:52,067 --> 00:37:53,235
SHE WAS
THE STRONGEST

1075
00:37:53,235 --> 00:37:55,604
IN THE RUNWAY COMPETITION
FOR ME.

1076
00:37:55,604 --> 00:37:58,474
Eric: I THINK YOANNA,
