1078
00:38:02,044 --> 00:38:04,613
Tyra: I THINK YOANNA'S FACE
IS SO STRIKING.

1079
00:38:04,613 --> 00:38:06,381
SHE LIVES AND BREATHES
THE MODELING.

1080
00:38:06,381 --> 00:38:08,417
SHE LIVES AND BREATHES
THE DESIGNERS.

1081
00:38:08,417 --> 00:38:09,585
AND YOANNA KNOWS IT,

1082
00:38:09,585 --> 00:38:11,620
AND I'M REALLY IMPRESSED
BY THAT.

1083
00:38:11,620 --> 00:38:14,156
Nigel: BUT THE THING IS
MERCEDES HAS THAT PERSONALITY

1084
00:38:14,156 --> 00:38:16,325
WHICH, YOU KNOW,
YOU WANNA BOOK,

1085
00:38:16,325 --> 00:38:17,659
AND SHE CAN MOVE
REALLY WELL.

1086
00:38:17,659 --> 00:38:20,496
Eric: I THINK YOANNA
HAS THE "X" FACTOR IN HER,

1087
00:38:20,496 --> 00:38:22,698
WHICH IS
I'M NOT REALLY SURE

1088
00:38:22,698 --> 00:38:24,099
WHAT'S GONNA COME OUT
OF HER MOUTH,

1089
00:38:24,099 --> 00:38:25,667
OR I'M NOT REALLY SURE
WHAT SHE'S GONNA DO

1090
00:38:25,667 --> 00:38:27,936
IN FRONT OF THE CAMERA,
AND THAT'S EXCITING.

1091
00:38:27,936 --> 00:38:29,705
Tyra: YEAH, BUT MERCEDES
HAS THAT PERSONALITY

1092
00:38:29,705 --> 00:38:31,373
THAT IS A TOP MODEL
PERSONALITY,

1093
00:38:31,373 --> 00:38:33,308
AND SHE'S FIGHTING
A DISEASE.

1094
00:38:33,308 --> 00:38:35,043
SHE HAS THESE THINGS
AND THESE EXPERIENCES

1095
00:38:35,043 --> 00:38:36,211
THAT YOU LOOK
AT THIS SWEET GIRL

1096
00:38:36,211 --> 00:38:37,613
AND YOU GO, "WOW,
I DIDN'T KNOW THAT."

1097
00:38:37,613 --> 00:38:39,982
Janice: THAT'S WHY
I LOVE MERCEDES.

1098
00:38:39,982 --> 00:38:41,650
I THINK MERCEDES
IS A SURVIVOR.

1099
00:38:41,650 --> 00:38:43,619
SHE'S BLOWING ME
AWAY.

1100
00:38:43,619 --> 00:38:45,187
Nigel: SHE REALLY WAS ONE
OF THE BEST GIRLS

1101
00:38:45,187 --> 00:38:46,255
ON THE RUNWAY
YESTERDAY,

1102
00:38:46,255 --> 00:38:47,422
BUT THE THING IS,

1103
00:38:47,422 --> 00:38:49,124
