1107
00:38:54,496 --> 00:38:57,065
Nigel: OH, NO DOUBT ABOUT IT--
I PREFERRED WATCHING MERCEDES.

1108
00:38:57,065 --> 00:38:58,400
Janice: THANK YOU.

