1111
00:39:05,040 --> 00:39:06,275
Nigel: YOU'VE HIT THE NAIL
ON THE HEAD, I THINK.

1112
00:39:06,275 --> 00:39:07,409
Janice: THERE YOU GO.

1113
00:39:07,409 --> 00:39:09,311
Nigel: THIS IS VERY TOUGH
FOR ME.

1114
00:39:21,156 --> 00:39:24,126
Tyra: WAS THE WAIT DIFFICULT
WHILE THE JUDGES DELIBERATED?

1115
00:39:24,126 --> 00:39:25,561
WHAT WAS GOING THROUGH
YOUR MIND, YOANNA?

1116
00:39:25,561 --> 00:39:27,196
Yoanna: UM, UNCERTAINTY.

1117
00:39:27,196 --> 00:39:28,430
Tyra: MERCEDES?

1118
00:39:28,430 --> 00:39:29,932
Mercedes: INSECURITY.

1119
00:39:29,932 --> 00:39:30,632
Tyra: WELL, YOU MIGHT HAVE
BEEN UNCERTAIN,

1120
00:39:30,632 --> 00:39:33,435
AND YOU MIGHT
HAVE BEEN INSECURE,

1121
00:39:33,435 --> 00:39:38,207
BUT YOU GUYS HAVE COME
A LONG WAY.

1122
00:39:38,207 --> 00:39:40,576
YOU LOOK AT THAT SCREEN
RIGHT THERE.

1123
00:39:40,576 --> 00:39:43,078
WE ARE ABOUT
TO FIND OUT

1124
00:39:43,078 --> 00:39:48,183
WHO WILL BE
AMERICA'S NEXT TOP MODEL.

1125
00:39:50,452 --> 00:39:52,254
YOANNA,

1126
00:39:52,254 --> 00:39:56,592
YOU STARTED OFF AS THE QUIRKY,
KIND OF WEIRD GIRL,

1127
00:39:56,592 --> 00:39:58,126
AND YOU HAVE
TRANSFORMED

1128
00:39:58,126 --> 00:40:04,366
INTO THIS HIP, STYLISH,
GORGEOUS BEING.

1129
00:40:05,601 --> 00:40:10,272
A FACE LIKE YOURS
DOES NOT COME AROUND OFTEN.

1130
00:40:10,272 --> 00:40:14,543
MERCEDES, YOU STARTED OFF
AS THE CUTE GIRL IN THE MALL,

1131
00:40:14,543 --> 00:40:16,211
AND THE JUDGES
WERE LIKE,

1132
00:40:16,211 --> 00:40:17,346
"OH, SHE'S SO COMMERCIAL.
SHE'S SO COMMERCIAL,"

1133
00:40:17,346 --> 00:40:20,048
BUT, GIRL,
YOU EDGY RIGHT NOW.

1134
00:40:20,048 --> 00:40:21,516
YOU HAVE MADE
THAT TRANSFORMATION.

1135
00:40:21,516 --> 00:40:24,119
YOU HAVE MADE
THAT LEAP.

1136
00:40:24,119 --> 00:40:26,688
EVEN THOUGH YOU GUYS HAVE COME
VERY FAR,

1137
00:40:26,688 --> 00:40:28,991
THERE'S
ONLY ONE SPOT.

1138
00:40:34,963 --> 00:40:36,999
Tyra: AMERICA'S
NEXT TOP MODEL IS...

1139
00:40:44,439 --> 00:40:47,009
Tyra: YOANNA.

1140
00:40:47,009 --> 00:40:49,077
YOANNA IS
AMERICA'S NEXT TOP MODEL.

1141
00:40:51,546 --> 00:40:52,981
Yoanna: THANK YOU SO MUCH.

1142
00:40:52,981 --> 00:40:53,982
Tyra: CONGRATULATIONS.

1143
00:40:53,982 --> 00:40:55,350
Yoanna: THANK YOU.

1144
00:40:55,350 --> 00:40:57,319
Tyra: YOANNA LIVED
AND BREATHED FASHION, STYLE

1145
00:40:57,319 --> 00:40:59,354
AND MODELING
SINCE CHILDHOOD.

1146
00:40:59,354 --> 00:41:01,556
YOANNA'S DREAM
HAS COME TRUE.

1147
00:41:01,556 --> 00:41:04,092
AND THE FASHION INDUSTRY
HAD BETTER HOLD ON TIGHT

1148
00:41:04,092 --> 00:41:06,361
'CAUSE YOANNA'S
ABOUT TO ROCK YOUR WORLD.

1149
00:41:06,361 --> 00:41:08,964
♪♪♪

1150
00:41:14,536 --> 00:41:17,940
Mercedes: I WANTED IT
SO BAD.

1151
00:41:17,940 --> 00:41:20,375
AND I DREAMED
OF THIS MOMENT HAPPENING,

1152
00:41:20,375 --> 00:41:23,045
BUT IT AIN'T
GOING AWAY.

1153
00:41:23,045 --> 00:41:25,314
Yoanna: (screams)

1154
00:41:25,314 --> 00:41:26,381
IT'S NOT REAL.

1155
00:41:26,381 --> 00:41:29,384
THANK YOU.

1156
00:41:29,384 --> 00:41:33,055
THANK YOU SO MUCH.

1157
00:41:33,055 --> 00:41:35,324
♪ I NEVER WAS A CHEERLEADER ♪♪

1158
00:41:35,324 --> 00:41:36,992
NEVER MADE
THE SQUAD.

1159
00:41:36,992 --> 00:41:39,728
NEVER MADE HOMECOMING
OR PROM QUEEN, NOTHING.

1160
00:41:39,728 --> 00:41:42,331
I WAS ALWAYS JUST THERE,
AND I NEVER WON,

1161
00:41:42,331 --> 00:41:44,399
AND NOW I'M
AMERICA'S NEXT TOP MODEL.

1162
00:41:44,399 --> 00:41:47,536
♪♪♪

1163
00:42:10,192 --> 00:42:12,294
(giggling)
YOU SHUT UP.

1164
